#. api.astroway.info
#: includes/views/admin-api-key.php:481
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Every row below the first one is about calling api.astroway.info from your "
"own code. The widgets on your pages are not affected by any of it. Canonical"
" pricing → %s"
msgstr ""
"Кожен рядок нижче першого стосується звернень до api.astroway.info з вашого "
